.TH MARK-SHOT-TRANSLATE 1 "August 2026" "Mark Shot 0.1.49" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mark-shot-translate \- translate recognized Mark Shot text
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/libexec/mark-shot/mark-shot-translate
.BI \-\-input " json"
.RB [ \-\-target-language
.IR language ]
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR path ]
.RB [ \-\-format
.BR json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sends recognized text to the configured OpenAI-compatible translation service
and prints structured JSON results.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mark-shot (1),
.BR mark-shot-ocr (1)
